{"ID":"20240513083019-jaa17so","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083019-jaa17so","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083019-jaa17so\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172301-jscugj1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172301-jscugj1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172301-jscugj1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:269\u0026#125;","title":"294","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124922"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513172301-jscugj1","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 958px;","id":"20240513172301-jscugj1","updated":"20240515124922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"218-8 L, YH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"69歲  瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/27"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝癌"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 最近睡眠較差，食慾較差。自述5/12方服後吃得好睡得好。大便好。小便深黃，小便量不多，一天五到六次，每次量少。身熱。雙足熱。口渴喜涼飲。味覺好。肝區痛仍有但改善很多。有痔瘡，便後擦拭肛門會痛，沒出血。腹脹仍有。心臟被抓住的感覺輕很多了。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一息七至，有力。肝脈很大，右手眽很小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→此乃有陰實堵到。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃乾"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、眼診 : 望其今日氣色光亮，查其手掌色粉紅，手指色暗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 足三里、陰陵泉、章門、期門、中脘、水分、巨闕＋關元＋水道、公孫＋內關、左肝關。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.胃苓湯  400粉 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.同5/12方加白芍五錢  當歸二錢  赤小豆五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五帖  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成3碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.HT-68 養肝丸 一斤 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 5/15分消湯   餐間服 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.HT-26 治痛風  發病時吃50粒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.沒有腹水時開胃用平胃散；有腹水時開胃用胃苓湯 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.師曰：腹水含有營養，排太快會貧血，會令癌細胞去搶其他營養。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.肝病的人最怕大小便不出。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.倪師認為他服5/22方會受不了睡不好是因為5/22方乃5/12方加白芍、補骨脂，是補骨脂造成的，補了他反而會受不了，此時若給他斑龍丸等補腎藥他也會不舒服。當初給他補腎是欲令其水去生木，治肝要瀉南補北。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}